    nw_24: "Any small team",
    nw_25: "Any",
    nw_26: "When a client asks for a system that is not on the list, we connect it. It is a routine request, not a special project: it is exactly what we do every month.",
    nw_27: "How many devices are reporting, how many are down and how many never reported since they were registered. The number at the top already tells you if the day is going well or badly.",
