    nw_33: "Where GPS data feeds risk calculation, the premium or claims reporting.",
    nw_34: "FUEC up to date, without redoing it by hand",
    nw_35: "The FUEC is the document a special transport vehicle must carry for the whole trip. Without it, the journey is not compliant.",
    nw_36: "The Single Contract Extract Form is mandatory for special transport in Colombia: school, corporate, tourism and health. Here it is issued, stored and consulted from the same account you use for your tracking software.",
    nw_37: "The case it is named for: flagging units about to expire before you lose the renewal.",
    nw_38: "The client who says “I have my own system”: that is exactly the sale you win with this.",
    nw_39: "Email gets lost and SMS costs money. WhatStar links WhatsApp numbers to your platform so fleet alerts, customer service and campaigns go out through the channel people open every day.",
    nw_40: "The time breakdown separates the urgent from the old: under an hour, 1 to 6, 6 to 24, 1 to 7 days, 7 to 30, and over 30 days.",
    nw_41: "The document the law requires",
    nw_42: "The ranking shows which customers have the most devices down, so you can start with the one closest to complaining.",
    nw_43: "The reseller hangs off you: you see their units, you invoice them, and you can activate or suspend them. If a reseller leaves, their customers do not leave with the platform.",
    nw_44: "The reseller has their own name, logo, colours and web address. Their end customer sees neither the reseller’s brand above nor yours below.",
    nw_45: "Issued from your panel account",
    nw_46: "Companies with dozens or hundreds of vehicles that cannot check device by device every day.",
    nw_47: "Special transport companies",
