    nw_63: "The likely cause, without guessing",
    nw_64: "The connection is made through web services with dedicated credentials and scoped permissions. The client’s system sees what it should see, and nothing else.",
    nw_65: "Data travels both ways",
    nw_66: "The list of repeat offenders: the ones that go down, come back and go down again. That is where you lose the customer without noticing.",
    nw_67: "Most distributors are surprised by the very first screen.",
    nw_68: "Conversations and sends are stored on the platform, not on the phone of an employee who leaves tomorrow.",
