    nw_77: "Tracking software events go out by WhatsApp with the wording you define: speeding, geofence entry and exit, power cut, and whatever else you configure.",
    nw_78: "The ones that fail again and again",
    nw_79: "Those who need vehicle position to flow into their dispatch, order or traceability system.",
    nw_80: "Manual included",
    nw_81: "More than 380 connections already running",
    nw_82: "No large client changes their systems just to add GPS. That is why our platform connects to what the client already uses: their ERP, their billing, their fuel control, their insurance system. And if the one they need is not on the list, we connect it.",
    nw_83: "It is not a generic form: it is made for companies moving schoolchildren, staff, tourists and patients.",
    nw_84: "This is not a brochure promise: these are integrations already running today with real clients. When you sell, you are not selling future development.",
    nw_85: "No need to log in and check: the alert arrives on its own when something goes down, with the device and the affected customer.",
    nw_86: "No new user to create and no password to remember: it is the same one you use for your tracking software.",
    nw_87: "Phone notification, email and WhatsApp. Whoever does not open the app finds out anyway.",
    nw_88: "Our platform can hand data to the client’s system and also receive from it. This is not just exporting a file.",
