    tp_badge:'Phone Tracking',
    tp_title:'TrackPhone — <span style="color:#D80C1C">Phone Tracking.</span>',
    tp_desc:'TrackPhone turns a person\'s phone into a GPS tracking unit that appears automatically on your platform, just like any vehicle. No extra equipment: just the app.',
    tp_stat1:'GPS devices to install', tp_stat2_v:'Live', tp_stat2:'Position on your platform', tp_stat3:'Background reporting', tp_stat4:'Integrated with your GPS platform',
    tp_feat_title:'One phone, one more tracking unit',
    tp_f1t:'Turns the phone into a GPS unit', tp_f1d:'The person shows up on your tracking platform as one more unit, next to your vehicles, with no extra equipment.',
    tp_f2t:'Login with tracker IMEI or ID', tp_f2d:'The operator creates the unit on the platform and hands over the credentials; the person logs into TrackPhone with that IMEI or ID and starts reporting.',
    tp_f3t:'Explicit consent, only once', tp_f3d:'On first login the person agrees to be tracked. It is a clear consent gate, not a permanent reminder.',
    tp_f4t:'Live tracking confirmation', tp_f4d:'The main screen confirms ACTIVE status, battery, last report, speed and today\'s kilometers. No doubt whether it is working.',
    tp_f5t:'Automatic power saving', tp_f5d:'When the battery runs low, TrackPhone extends the reporting interval to save charge, without stopping transmission.',
    tp_f6t:'The map lives on your platform', tp_f6d:'TrackPhone only transmits; the map, history and reports stay on your GPS platform, alongside the rest of your fleet.',
    tp_uc_title:'For people you need to see on the map',
    tp_uc1t:'Field workers', tp_uc1d:'Mobile staff outside the office whose location you need to know in real time.',
