    sl_badge:'Satellite Connectivity',
    sl_title:'SatLink — <span style="color:#E50515">Satellite Connectivity.</span>',
    sl_desc:'SatLink receives the positions your equipment sends over satellite networks (Iridium, Globalstar and others) and automatically re-injects them into your GPS software, so your vehicles and assets stay on the map even where there is no cellular signal.',
    sl_stat1:'Blind spots without reporting', sl_stat2_v:'Global', sl_stat2:'Satellite coverage', sl_stat3:'Continuous reporting', sl_stat4:'Re-injected into your GPS software',
    sl_feat_title:'Your units on the map, beyond cellular coverage too',
    sl_f1t:'Tracking where cellular signal does not reach', sl_f1d:'Satellite network connection (Iridium/RockBLOCK, Globalstar) so your units keep reporting in jungle, sea, mountains or any area without coverage.',
    sl_f2t:'Automatic re-injection into the GPS software', sl_f2d:'Satellite positions flow into your platform on their own via the OsmAnd protocol, alongside the rest of the fleet, with no operator action.',
    sl_f3t:'Compatible with satellite networks', sl_f3d:'One adapter per network or device: Iridium/RockBLOCK, Globalstar and more. Adding a new network means adding an adapter, not rewriting the system.',
    sl_f4t:'Raw frame decoding', sl_f4d:'It interprets the SBD messages and bytes each device sends according to its firmware, and turns them into a map-ready position.',
    sl_f5t:'Secure multi-tenant console', sl_f5d:'Each distributor sees only their own equipment. Every provider webhook is protected with its own access key.',
    sl_f6t:'Complete relay log', sl_f6d:'A record of every message received: whether it was re-injected into the GPS software or discarded and why. Full traceability of the satellite flow.',
    sl_uc_title:'To operate where there is no cellular coverage',
    sl_uc1t:'River and maritime transport', sl_uc1d:'Boats, launches and barges on rivers and open sea, where cellular signal does not reach but tracking cannot fail.',
    sl_uc2t:'Mining and remote areas', sl_uc2d:'Equipment and stations in jungle, plains or mountains where there are no cell towers but there is open sky for the satellite.',
    sl_uc3t:'Long-haul cargo', sl_uc3d:'Trucks that cross stretches without coverage between cities and must keep reporting the whole route, with no gaps on the map.',
    sl_uc4t:'Isolated fixed assets', sl_uc4d:'Stations, plants and sensors in remote sites that need continuous monitoring in your own GPS platform.',
    sl_sc_title:'SatLink on screen',
