    ip_feat_title:'Smart inspections from start to finish',
    ip_f1_title:'Unlimited customizable templates',
    ip_f1_desc:'Design, clone and edit checklists with text, photos, multiple choice, digital signature and rating. Each company configures its own forms to match its operation.',
    ip_f2_title:'Supervisor approval workflow',
    ip_f2_desc:'The supervisor approves ✅ or rejects ❌ with a reason. On rejection, the driver receives the inspection back with an orange notice and must correct it. Action plans are logged in the history.',
    ip_f3_title:'AI + license plate OCR',
    ip_f3_desc:'Parses physical forms from a photo using artificial intelligence. Automatic license plate OCR to register inspections without manually typing the plate number.',
    ip_f4_title:'Document expiry alerts',
    ip_f4_desc:'Monitors insurance, technical inspections, licenses and any vehicle document. Generates automatic alerts before expiry so the fleet always operates in compliance.',
    ip_f5_title:'PDF, CSV reports and dashboard',
    ip_f5_desc:'PDF reports with digital signature and geotagged photos. Export to CSV or ZIP. Compliance dashboard with expected vs completed inspections, trends and analytics.',
    ip_f6_title:'QR, push notifications and API',
    ip_f6_desc:'QR per vehicle or form. Push notifications to the driver when an inspection is rejected. API keys and webhooks for external system integration. Complete audit logs.',
