    cf_title:'Your fleet, <span style="color:#7C3AED">seen in real time.</span>',
    cf_desc:'CamFleet integrates dashcam and cabin cameras with your GPS platform. Live streaming, continuous recording with cloud backup, automatic event detection (braking, collisions, drowsiness) and instant legal evidence for any incident.',
