    cf_f1_desc:'Watch all cameras live from the browser. The MediaMTX server retransmits the dashcam\'s JT1078 stream in HLS, RTSP and WebRTC with no plugins or apps required.',
    cf_f2_title:'Native JT808 / JT1078 protocol',
    cf_f2_desc:'Direct connection with Jimi and Concox dashcams (JC181, JC450, DC600) via JT808/JT1078 protocol. No external converters: the camera connects directly to the server.',
