    cf_f3_desc:'Each event generates an associated video clip: event type, vehicle, date and time. Download any clip from the panel without accessing the physical device.',
    cf_f4_title:'WhatsApp alerts with evidence',
    cf_f4_desc:'Configure alert contacts per vehicle. When an event occurs, the system sends the notice via WhatsApp with the video clip attached as immediate evidence.',
    cf_f5_title:'GPS + synchronized drivers',
    cf_f5_desc:'Each camera has an associated vehicle and optionally a driver. The map shows real-time position and you can view the stream directly from the vehicle pin.',
    cf_f6_title:'Event dashboard by type and day',
    cf_f6_desc:'Executive summary with total cameras, active streams, events by type and daily trend. Identify vehicles with the most incidents at a glance.',
