    tr_badge:'BLE Asset Tracking',
    tr_title:'Know where <span style="color:#10B981">every asset is, always.</span>',
    tr_desc:'TagRadar uses long-life BLE tags detected by fixed or mobile antennas. The map shows in real time the last antenna that detected each asset. No GPS, no SIM: works indoors, in yards and warehouses where GPS doesn\'t reach.',
    tr_stat_1:'Latest generation technology',
    tr_stat_2:'Map update frequency',
    tr_stat_3:'Tag battery life',
    tr_stat_4:'No connectivity cost',
    tr_feat_title:'From inventory chaos to total control',
    tr_f1_title:'Last position by antenna',
    tr_f1_desc:'Each BLE tag is captured by the nearest antenna. The map shows in real time the position of the antenna that last detected it, updated every 20 seconds.',
    tr_f2_title:'Geofences with entry/exit alerts',
    tr_f2_desc:'Define zones for each asset or group. Receive an immediate alert when equipment enters or leaves the assigned area. Configurable per zone and asset.',
    tr_f3_title:'24-hour route history',
    tr_f3_desc:'Query the complete detection history of any asset in the last 24 hours: the antenna that saw it, exact time and position. Total traceability.',
    tr_f4_title:'Real-time asset states',
    tr_f4_desc:'<strong>Live</strong> (detected &lt;5 min ago), <strong>Recent</strong> (&lt;2 h) or <strong>Inactive</strong> (&gt;2 h). At a glance you know which assets are being monitored and which haven\'t reported recently.',
    tr_f5_title:'Asset and antenna management',
    tr_f5_desc:'Register, edit and delete tags with name and description. Check which antennas are active, when they last reported and how many assets they\'ve detected.',
    tr_f6_title:'Android app + SSO with Appogio',
